workflow-heading = Check and repair metadata: combined workflow
workflow-description = Selecting a module enables all its checking and formatting rules; clearing it disables them. A mixed state indicates partially enabled rules. Optional blank-field metadata retrieval and journal rankings reuse the existing tools. Destructive maintenance tools are excluded. Automatic imports retain their separate settings.
workflow-metadata = Retrieve article metadata first (fill blanks, preserve type)
workflow-rankings = Update journal quartiles and rankings last
workflow-title = All title and short-title checks and formatters
workflow-creators = All creator checks and formatters
workflow-identifiers = All DOI checks, retrieval and formatting
workflow-pagination = All volume, issue and page formatters
workflow-publication = All publication and conference name formatters
workflow-other = Other item, language, date and type rules
